    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d886">

                <pb facs="0833" n="823" sameAs="frus:frus1941v05/pg823"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.102S/2405: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-01-27T14:00:00+09:00">January 27, 1941—2
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received January 27—11:26 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>121. Department’s 55, January 25, 3 p.m., which we have repeated to Shanghai.
                    Wounding of presiding officer of Shanghai Municipal Council.</p>
                <pb facs="0834" n="824" xml:id="pg824"/>
                <p>In an interview today with the Minister for Foreign Affairs I made informal
                    comment on the incident as authorized by the Department. The Minister said that
                    he was angry and ashamed at the incident, that the Japanese Consul General in
                        Shanghai<anchor n="76" xml:id="d886-f1"/> ought never to have allowed the
                    position of the representative of the Japanese Rate Payers to be held by such an
                    irresponsible and [<hi rendition="#italic">sic</hi>] individual who is believed
                    to control houses of prostitution in Shanghai, and that drastic action under
                    Japanese law will be taken against the assailant.</p>
                <p>Sent to the Department via Shanghai.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
